   what happened to each run's winners in the OTHER run:
      M=3840 router  (run13 winner )  run13  +3.12 -> run14  +0.81   (-2.30)
      M=1344 router  (run14 winner )  run13  -0.22 -> run14  +4.22   (+4.44)
